      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review",
      "reason": "The title identifies the report as a review ('an integrative review'), but does not use the term 'systematic review.' An integrative review is a related but distinct methodology, so the report is only partially identified as a systematic review in the title."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review",
      "reason": "The title clearly conveys the main objective/review question: identifying approaches used to evaluate sustainability of evidence-based interventions (the intervention/exposure) in healthcare (the population/context)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review",
      "reason": "The title provides supplementary methodological information by specifying the review design ('integrative review'), informing readers of the study design used."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 85
